<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Radio Centro started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Radio Centro started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>HSBC James Capel started coverage of Mexican broadcaster Grupo Radio Centro Wednesday with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- The firm set a mid-1998 target price of $19.50 for the American Depositary Receipt (ADR).</p>
<p>-- The company's ADRs closed Tuesday at 11-7/8.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
